        <mxCell id="mG6i4hQfEeHpLoGXTpvo-41" value="&lt;b&gt;Approval Setting&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Id (Guid)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;EntityType (string)&lt;br&gt;RequiredApprovals (int)&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;e.g. at least 2 reviewers must approve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;AllowSelfApproval (bool) e.g. author can approve their own post&lt;br&gt;BlockOnReject (bool) e.g. a single reject block further approvals&lt;br&gt;RequireReapprovalOnChange (bool) e.g. reviews reset after edits&lt;br&gt;AutoApproveIfThresholdMet (bool) e.g. auto&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;set Approval.Status=Approved&lt;br&gt;MustBeInRoleToApprove (bool) e.g. if in one of the roles in the ApprovalSettingsRole then you can approve/reject item&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
